c zpa-accordion-131 zpa-is-new-structure zp ba-14762574" id="14762574" data-id="14762574"> <div class="js-cluster zp cac-14762574"> <div class="zp raw-3537883"> <div class="zp ra-3537883 center-xs flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12"> <div class="zp ca-6996279 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zp ewc-10577424 zpa-el-accordion-grid" data-id="10577424"> <ul class="zp ea-10577424 flex-row"> <li class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-with-divider zp eda-10577424" data-faq-item> <div class="zp ca-6996280 zpa-column-content"> <div class="flex-row zpa-el-accordion-question-text"> <a class="zpa-btn-custom zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-10577424" aria-labelledby="zpaiqt-10577425" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="zpai-6996280" role="button" tabindex="0" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div id="zpaiqt-10577425" class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-10577425"> Will this charge my device even with my case on? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--chevron" aria-label="Open" data-toggle-icon> <use href="#arrowIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div id="zpai-6996280" class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-answer> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12"> <div class="zp ca-6996285 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577446"> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-2">Our wireless charging devices have been tested with many cases. The maximum charge distance on this product is 8mm, therefore this should be suitable for most cases. The only type of case where we found any issue are cases with metallic backs that interfere with the transfer of power.</h4> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-4">In case you have a metallic case, please remove your case first to ensure proper operation.</h4> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-with-divider zp eda-10577424" data-faq-item> <div class="zp ca-6996281 zpa-column-content"> <div class="flex-row zpa-el-accordion-question-text"> <a class="zpa-btn-custom zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-10577424" aria-labelledby="zpaiqt-10577427" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="zpai-6996281" role="button" tabindex="0" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div id="zpaiqt-10577427" class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-10577427"> What devices is this cable compatible with? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--chevron" aria-label="Open" data-toggle-icon> <use href="#arrowIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div id="zpai-6996281" class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-answer> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12"> <div class="zp ca-6996286 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577447"> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-2">Devices with Qi Wireless Charging 2.0, 3.0, or Samsung Wireless Charging certifications are compatible with the Titan 15W Wireless Fast Charging Dock. The list of fast charging devices includes, but is not limited to:</h4> <ul class="zp ts-regular-1 zpa-text__list zpa-text__list--disc"> <li class="zp tsl-4"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">iPhone 8 and up</p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-6"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">Samsung Galaxy S6 and up</p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-8"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">Google Pixel 2 and up</p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-10"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">Sony Xperia Z3 and up</p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-12"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">Razer Phone 1 and up</p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-14"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">ASUS ROG Phone and up</p> </li> <li class="zp tsl-16"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1">Any 2017 flagship model and up</p> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-with-divider zp eda-10577424" data-faq-item> <div class="zp ca-6996282 zpa-column-content"> <div class="flex-row zpa-el-accordion-question-text"> <a class="zpa-btn-custom zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-10577424" aria-labelledby="zpaiqt-10577429" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="zpai-6996282" role="button" tabindex="0" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div id="zpaiqt-10577429" class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-10577429"> How does the warranty work? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--chevron" aria-label="Open" data-toggle-icon> <use href="#arrowIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div id="zpai-6996282" class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-answer> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12"> <div class="zp ca-6996287 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577448"> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-2"><br></p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-3"><span class="zp tsl-4">We have so much confidence in our chargers' durability that we offer&nbsp;&nbsp;6 month warranty on all other products. This means that if anything happens, we'll send you a brand new charger, free of charge!</span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-5"> <span class="zp tsl-6">The warranty covers any defects in material or workmanship. Furthermore, if any unexpected or unreasonable damage occurs this will be cony cable sent out to you as a replacement will not be covered by this antywarr.vered. Any intentional damage or damage caused by unconventional use will not be covered.</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-8"><br></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-with-divider zp eda-10577424" data-faq-item> <div class="zp ca-6996283 zpa-column-content"> <div class="flex-row zpa-el-accordion-question-text"> <a class="zpa-btn-custom zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-10577424" aria-labelledby="zpaiqt-10577431" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="zpai-6996283" role="button" tabindex="0" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div id="zpaiqt-10577431" class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-10577431"> Is this charger safe to use with my device? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--chevron" aria-label="Open" data-toggle-icon> <use href="#arrowIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div id="zpai-6996283" class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-answer> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12"> <div class="zp ca-6996288 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577449"> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-2">This charger delivers fast charging at an amperage level that is supported by your mobile device and will therefore not cause any damage. Pair this charger with a high-quality charging cable such as the Titan Smart Cable to provide the best combination for keeping your device safe.</h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1"> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </li> <li class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12 zpa-accordion__item zpa-accordion__item--appearance-with-divider zp eda-10577424" data-faq-item> <div class="zp ca-6996284 zpa-column-content"> <div class="flex-row zpa-el-accordion-question-text"> <a class="zpa-btn-custom zpa-accordion__question zp ewa-10577424" aria-labelledby="zpaiqt-10577433" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="zpai-6996284" role="button" tabindex="0" data-faq-header> <div class="xs-12 zpa-accordion__question-content"> <div id="zpaiqt-10577433" class="zpa-offset-right-sm zp ea-10577433"> What are the product specifications? </div> <svg width="16px" height="16px" class="zpa-accordion__question-icon zpa-accordion__question-icon--chevron" aria-label="Open" data-toggle-icon> <use href="#arrowIcon"></use> </svg> </div> </a> </div> <div id="zpai-6996284" class="zpa-accordion__answer flex-row" aria-hidden="true" data-faq-answer> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-12 lg-12 md-12"> <div class="zp ca-6996289 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577450"> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-2"> <span class="zp tsl-3">For the Titan Wireless Fast Charging Dock the Product Specifications are as follows:</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-5"><span class="zp tsl-6"> </span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-8"> <span class="zp tsl-9">- This wireless charger is capable of charging in 2 orientations (both flat and standing using the included stand).</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-11"><span class="zp tsl-12"> </span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-14"> <span class="zp tsl-15">- The wireless charger has an output of 5W / 7.5W / 10W / 15W.</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-17"><span class="zp tsl-18"> </span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-20"> <span class="zp tsl-21">- The charging distance for this device is 8mm maximum.</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-23"><span class="zp tsl-24"> </span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-26"> <span class="zp tsl-27">- Input: 5V = 2A, 9V = 2.5A Max</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-29"><span class="zp tsl-30"> </span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-32"> <span class="zp tsl-33">- Included with this device is a cable, however this is not a smart cable. Titan Smart Cables are sold separately.</span></h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1 tsl-35"><span class="zp tsl-36"> </span></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-38"> <span class="zp tsl-39">*While the Titan Wireless Charging Dock is a Wireless Charger the device will only charge phones capable of wireless charging (for more info see the compatibility tab) and will itself need to be plugged in at all times while functioning.</span></h4> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="js-cluster-wrapper zpa-three-images-with-titles-1-024-v1-dynamic zpa-three-images-with-titles-024 zpa-is-new-structure zp ba-14762585" id="14762585" data-id="14762585"> <div class="js-cluster zp cac-14762585"> <div class="zp raw-3537894"> <div class="zp ra-3537894 center-xs flex-row"> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-4 lg-4 md-4"> <div class="zp ca-6996302 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zp mcwa-10577457 zpa-el-image"> <div class="zp zpa-image-container mca-10577457" data-id="10577457"> <img width="300" height="198" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw,1030px,942px,830px,720px,590px,450px,220px" srcset="https://cdn05.zipify.com/B5jt2kWjkSX4BjIyuIRyZU5c-Tg=/fit-in/220x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 220w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/Ufv9rwj1mvuvZLU9V-dgsHy-j2E=/fit-in/450x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 450w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/c71AawL6JfaIT53xTAUP4I2xNxU=/fit-in/590x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 590w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/r58-Hq9Hjrp4JeMzXmzB2_M-6Uw=/fit-in/720x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 720w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/DczBS2Sose9xK8o65tB9BqSjoDc=/fit-in/830x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 830w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/sWfnxD-Teg5tL0rev2lpO_Dp6xA=/fit-in/942x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 942w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/Tfn_6yFYh0H8QiAg-N7Fpl81Za8=/fit-in/1030x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png 1030w" src="https://cdn05.zipify.com/Tfn_6yFYh0H8QiAg-N7Fpl81Za8=/fit-in/1030x0/286cae46113d4fdcb1da77071eacc7a3/safe-payment.png" class="zpa-img-fluid zp eswb-10577457 ea-10577457"> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577458"> <p class="zp ts-regular-3 tsl-2">OUR GUARANTEE</p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1"><br></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-4">If you have any problems with your order or you aren’t satisfied with your product, just let us know within 30 days and we’ll get you your money back! </h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1"><br></p> <h3 class="zp ts-h3 tsl-6">Our cables have a lifetime warranty so you're covered in case anything ever happens to them! </h3> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-4 lg-4 md-4"> <div class="zp ca-6996303 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zp mcwa-10577459 zpa-el-image"> <div class="zp zpa-image-container mca-10577459" data-id="10577459"> <img width="300" height="198" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw,1030px,942px,830px,720px,590px,450px,220px" srcset="https://cdn05.zipify.com/uVBwYwuQdy-zBNmI6b8qgcQjluQ=/fit-in/220x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 220w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/NGtea_Gl57PD5CH9XFEG_rmHnqA=/fit-in/450x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 450w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/K5uojMLtYg6en8AC6eqJi-dDNQY=/fit-in/590x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 590w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/s6GsFeqcEBMeNYt9fGa8DMKXrMk=/fit-in/720x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 720w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/bmhBFXydxJjYgJyfqWodF7nKCBM=/fit-in/830x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 830w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/KdBydDeuO32UK-ND7CNm47SlWN0=/fit-in/942x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 942w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/P1fEw1r0ioiloMEfNQX-7K9cnEI=/fit-in/1030x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png 1030w" src="https://cdn05.zipify.com/P1fEw1r0ioiloMEfNQX-7K9cnEI=/fit-in/1030x0/f844733dc3484f82a5414d8162700ba7/free-shiping.png" class="zpa-img-fluid zp eswb-10577459 ea-10577459"> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-position--relative zpa-word-wrap disable-internal-link zpa-el-text zp ea-10577460"> <p class="zp ts-regular-3 tsl-2">SHIPPING & TRACKING</p> <p class="zp ts-regular-1"><br></p> <h4 class="zp ts-h4 tsl-4">All shipments are trackable through the 'track order' page on our website. simply enter your order number and email address. due to high demand expect the following delivery times:</h4> <p class="zp ts-regular-1"><br></p> <h3 class="zp ts-h3 tsl-6">-US Delivery: 5-10 Working Days</h3> <h3 class="zp ts-h3 tsl-7">-UK/AU/NZ Delivery: 8-13 Working Days</h3> <h3 class="zp ts-h3 tsl-8">-International Delivery: 11-34 Working Days</h3> </div> </div> </div> <div class="zpa-flex--column zpa-flex xs-12 sm-4 lg-4 md-4"> <div class="zp ca-6996304 zpa-column-content"> <div class="zpa-position--relative zp mcwa-10577461 zpa-el-image"> <div class="zp zpa-image-container mca-10577461" data-id="10577461"> <img width="300" height="198" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw,1030px,942px,830px,720px,590px,450px,220px" srcset="https://cdn05.zipify.com/mdK3LNH7ZW70xjUhG3BtWaXmGZU=/fit-in/220x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 220w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/wB3v2Bz-lrECpZM3g_ArD1xHs-E=/fit-in/450x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 450w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/shpH84_zWtynoLzITqGXizmEKDk=/fit-in/590x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 590w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/kwk9ktN1o3F-Zsc4Y5_g82o__VA=/fit-in/720x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 720w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/7utWk34CAkdWbVZSdobDGcr8VJw=/fit-in/830x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 830w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/_rcp-SAaQYPqDVTdh_D_B0IFOls=/fit-in/942x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 942w, https://cdn05.zipify.com/FcdtgngNoebZ0259m3mQOTzPCbI=/fit-in/1030x0/94cfaaece7554c3a9ee82bf379bedb80/24-7-support.png 1030w" src="https://cdn05.zipify.com/FcdtgngNoebZ0259